<</E(Community loves comparisons, sometimes even more than customers do. Compare Rime with at least two alternative TTS systems for a clearly defined use case. Separate listening quality, text fidelity, latency, reliability, and controllability. Use comparable, provider-recommended configurations; document voice selection; blind provider identities for listening tests; and distinguish model latency from network latency and warm runs from cold runs. Publish the corpus, exact configurations, generated clips, item-level results, analysis code, and limitations. Report trade-offs instead of one unexplained score, and label small-sample findings as exploratory. Judges will score the fairness and usefulness of the evaluation, not whether Rime wins.)/K[ 17]/P 68 0 R /Pg 13 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
